            "content_descriptors": {
                "ids": [
                    5
                ],
                "notes": "This game explores possibly heavy themes such as anorexia, mental illness, as well as the inability to conceive children. Furthermore, one scene implies the existence of a sexual act that is not shown onscreen whose consent is dubious (altered state of mind).\r\n\r\nThere should be noted that the game’s presentation is based on a distorted perception of reality (unrealiable narrator). While the plot delves into psychological horror, it never attemps to sexualize minors. All the characters are over the age of 18, ‘Ambre’ does not exist.\r\n\r\nThe story’s content is not suitable for children or those who are not properly informed, reader discretion is advised."
            },
